              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nta wuhakana yukw ibanga ryo kwubaha Imana ridahambaye cane, n’iri: umwe yerekanywe afise umubiri, akaboneka kw ar’ umugororotsi mu mpwemu, akabonwa n’abamarayika, akamenyekanishwa mu banyamahanga, akizererwa mw isi, akadūzwa agahabga ubgiza.",
          "type": "text",
